<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35608" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-tergĕo</span></b> , tersi, tersum,
		2, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-tergo</span></b> ,
			ĕre, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to wipe off</i>, <i>wipe dry.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gausape purpureo mensam pertersit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					S. 2, 8, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spongia vasa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					12, 9, 2</span></i>
			. —* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>to rub</i> or <i>touch against gently</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(aër) quasi perterget pupillas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					4, 249</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lux oculos perterget,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 4,
					277</span></i>
			 Lachm. <i>N. cr.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nostros oculos perterget longior aura,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 4,
					252</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
